<draw:frame draw:layer="layout" svg:width="28cm" svg:height="15cm" svg:x="4cm" svg:y="5cm">
<draw:text-box>
<text:list>
<text:list-item><text:p>❌ <text:span>Most trading bots use LAGGING INDICATORS</text:span></text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p>   - RSI, MACD, Moving Averages</text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p>   - Always late to the market</text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p>❌ <text:span>Retail traders LOSE MONEY</text:span></text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p>   - No institutional logic</text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p>   - No risk management</text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p>❌ <text:span>Complex web interfaces</text:span></text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p>   - Heavy, slow, unnecessary overhead</text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p>✅ <text:span>SOLUTION: ENB Strategy + S/R</text:span></text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p>   - How SMART MONEY actually trades</text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p>   - CLI-based = Lightweight & Fast</text:p></text:list-item>
</text:list>
</draw:text-box>
</draw:frame>
</draw:page>

